Headphone correction profiles
-----------------------------
The equalizer can load headphone correction profiles from AutoEq
(https://github.com/jaakkopasanen/AutoEq), Copyright (c) 2018-2022 Jaakko
Pasanen, licensed under the MIT License. The profiles are downloaded from that
repository when the user searches for them; the measurements belong to the
sources credited there (oratory1990, crinacle, Rtings and others).

Android APK
-----------
The Android app bundles the Media3 FFmpeg audio decoder built by the Jellyfin
project (org.jellyfin.media3:media3-ffmpeg-decoder,
https://github.com/jellyfin/jellyfin-androidx-media), which includes FFmpeg
(https://ffmpeg.org). That build is licensed under the GNU General Public
License v3.0, therefore the APK as a combined work is distributed under
GPL-3.0. The corresponding source code is this repository plus the sources
published by those projects. The HomeFi source code itself remains
Apache-2.0 (which is compatible with GPL-3.0) and the CLI contains no GPL code.
